fullText:
  - "Fire as a stone thrower without a template. After scatter, the controlling player may move the landing point D6 inches in any direction. Every unit touched by the Doom Diver's base suffers D6 Strength 5 hits."
  - "Misfire 1-2 destroys the machine. On 3-4 it cannot shoot this turn or the controlling player's next turn. On 5 the diver hits the first thing toward the chosen target: terrain causes no damage; a friendly or enemy unit suffers D6 Strength 5 hits with no armour saves, then the diver is removed; the catapult works normally next turn. On 6 fire the diver D6×10 inches in a random direction without the usual D6 correction; the catapult works normally next turn."
