isSignature: false
type: hex
castingValues: [10]
shorthand: "Enemy mounts and chariot beasts within 12 inches attack their own riders or unit."
fullText:
  - "Each enemy Cavalry, Monstrous Cavalry, Chariot, ridden Monster, and monster-and-handler unit within 12 inches suffers a number of hits equal to the Attacks characteristics of its mounts, carriage beasts, or monsters. Riders receive no armour-save bonus from mounts or barding against these hits."
sourcePage: 104
